      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Hayward was settled around 1855 and formally incorporated as a city in 1925, marking its transition from a rural community to an official municipality.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hayward%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "By 1911, Hayward had become a bustling hub, featuring a railroad station, post office, and a mix of stores, a creamery, and a bank.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
