      ],
      "source": "https://www.cityofhaywardmn.gov/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1930, Hayward hosted the longest recorded game of horseshoes, pitting the postmaster against the train station agent.",
